{"4132090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FUTURO DARKO RACER", "steam_appid": 4132090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuro Darko Racer</strong> is a fast-paced racing game with shooting elements, inspired by the comic FUTURO DARKO by Krzysztof Nowak, published by Nagle! Comics. The game takes place in post-apocalyptic wastelands, where every race is a fight for survival. To win, you must outrun your opponents or simply destroy them! But beware — ruthless judges are watching to enforce the rules. If anyone catches you cheating, you’ll become the target and be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Game modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally – a classic gun race. You can be the first to win... or eliminate everyone when the judges aren't looking.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the Law – the police don't forget. Escape through the wasteland before they take your cash and freedom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Hunter – pursue and destroy your designated target. Bosses don't give up easily.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Arena – one track, no rules. Survive or burn with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Personalization and progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your vehicle - from the hood to the exhaust. Each victory increases your esteem, and with it, access to new parts and weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put cash or your own car as collateral. In Futuro Darko Racer, risk is currency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Story mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the American wasteland divided into zones - from rusty suburbs to futuristic metropolises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet gangs, bounty hunters, corrupt judges and freaks who have long lost faith in the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.poster.avif?t=1762330443\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.webm?t=1762330443\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e053a58403ac2d88fa.mp4?t=1762330443\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Why it's worth it</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >graphic style inspired by comics book FURURO DARKO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dynamic racing with fighting and shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >extensive tuning and improvements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >risk and betting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >full story campaign</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuro Darko Racer – drive, fight, survive. Or go down with the engine!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Futuro Darko Racer</strong> is a fast-paced racing game with shooting elements, inspired by the comic FUTURO DARKO by Krzysztof Nowak, published by Nagle! Comics. The game takes place in post-apocalyptic wastelands, where every race is a fight for survival. To win, you must outrun your opponents or simply destroy them! But beware — ruthless judges are watching to enforce the rules. If anyone catches you cheating, you’ll become the target and be eliminated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💥 <strong>Game modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rally – a classic gun race. You can be the first to win... or eliminate everyone when the judges aren't looking.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape from the Law – the police don't forget. Escape through the wasteland before they take your cash and freedom.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bounty Hunter – pursue and destroy your designated target. Bosses don't give up easily.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Death Arena – one track, no rules. Survive or burn with the rest.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🔧 <strong>Personalization and progression</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modify your vehicle - from the hood to the exhaust. Each victory increases your esteem, and with it, access to new parts and weapons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put cash or your own car as collateral. In Futuro Darko Racer, risk is currency.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌆 <strong>Story mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through the American wasteland divided into zones - from rusty suburbs to futuristic metropolises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet gangs, bounty hunters, corrupt judges and freaks who have long lost faith in the rules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132090/extras/5a7630e229d202e05